---
{{ title | yaml_property:"title" }}
{{ id | yaml_property:"id" }}
{{ parent | yaml_property:"parent" }}
{{ status | yaml_property:"status" }}
{% if tags %}tags: {{ tags | yaml:flow }}
{% endif %}{% if relations %}relations: {{ relations | yaml:flow }}
{% endif %}{% if published_at %}{{ published_at | yaml_property:"published_at" }}
{% endif %}{% if summary %}{{ summary | yaml_property:"summary" }}
{% endif %}---
{# filed-mascot.knap: a filed.fyi mascot record — an existing filing, not a
   fresh draft. Frontmatter is the shared filed prelude (closed boris
   schema only); canon sections render in skeleton order and each body is
   a verbatim string the extractor lifted from the record. Non-canon
   sections ride in `extra_sections` ({after, heading, level, body}) and
   re-emit right after the canon slot they followed in the doc. Ratchet-
   growable apparatus: `relationships` + `system_messages` lists, Field
   Testimony blockquotes with keyed footnotes, a Field Notes palette
   (callout|quote|list), the Provenance Ledger table. Shape:
   shapes/filed-mascot.json. #}
{% if title_heading %}


{{ title | h1 }}
{{ "" }}{% endif %}{% if card %}


{{ card }}
{{ "" }}{% endif %}{% for e in extra_sections | where:("after", "preamble") %}


{% if e.level == 1 %}{{ e.heading | h1 }}{% else %}{{ e.heading | h2 }}{% endif %}

{{ e.body }}
{% endfor %}{% if image %}


{{ "Image" | h2 }}

{{ image }}
{{ "" }}{% endif %}{% for e in extra_sections | where:("after", "image") %}


{% if e.level == 1 %}{{ e.heading | h1 }}{% else %}{{ e.heading | h2 }}{% endif %}

{{ e.body }}
{% endfor %}{% if biography %}


{{ "Biography" | h2 }}

{{ biography }}
{{ "" }}{% endif %}{% for e in extra_sections | where:("after", "biography") %}


